# Anchored patterns only. On Vercel an unanchored pattern matches at every depth.
# Deployed on purpose: /api /js /css /img /fonts /lib /data (minus /data/vectors), the root pages, icons, og.png,
# robots.txt, sitemap.xml, site.webmanifest, vercel.json, package.json.
/contracts
/tools
/reference
/partials
/notes
/docs
/data/vectors
/.venv
/.tmp
/.data
/.env*
/node_modules
/README.md
/SPEC*.md
/lib/*.test.*
/.git
/lib/README.md
